Z||000011||Steven||04-18-2001||02:44 PM||||I was sitting here reading this, and I got to thinking (I know 1st mistake), but the point of using carbon fiber is that it is strong and light. The purpose of plastic is it is cheap and light. If you put fake or look alike carbon fiber stickers on your plastic, doesn't that negate the reason for using a light material to begin with? I know "stickers don't weight that much", but it is the principal of it. Isn't it?||||reg||5
